bind Information Collect: Identifier Information, Category Information
bind Information Examine: Identifier Information, Rating Effect
bind Document Assess: Identifier Reviewer
bind Document Authorize: Identifier Authorization
bind Response Gather: Category Response
bind Document Edit: Category Edit
Identifier Information: integer between 1 and 10000
Category Information: Environmental, Social, Governance
Identifier Reviewer: integer between 1 and 5000
Identifier Authorization: integer between 1 and 5000
Rating Effect: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Category Response: Positive, Negative, Neutral
Category Edit: Minor, Major
